ttps://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1529002214897731_3972277647533721287_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZtApCv5TClkQ7kNvwE4GB6m&_nc_oc=AdplpYxuwfiXOwh0hZU6-9RpiueqOtGrCX2bX8ipruRCq0B9UkM8IPzebUi7XmmeqZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQILb6RFr30xb0JxcvZYTZ81CT4bTHcUeVYV3MMeu0vSrA&oe=6A9FFFEE"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2069435990464276", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_2069435993797609_8465963022420078642_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nZ0sguFvR78Q7kNvwF_Tf3x&_nc_oc=Adq7i7CcPoPKcyp88eWGdcczqA-8fBNx7hBdw44pWPikWH7M18I09foLVe8EntCtb4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLaNV03ocOSB0Mv4glTOEDssTvpSfgt31_2SS51tTJeyg&oe=6AA00A8D"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "2056719251736466", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_2056719255069799_4126424375528299896_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U-k68z3mmJcQ7kNvwFSsFwv&_nc_oc=AdpqfZqEcK9fEG1jskqMLOuAHq6cn_jSRaMPm-y6YyFVK1aLwd2URGXf6m1SiIRkYnE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIme49wS3U9HbinZxqc4qvKaJIUmHKLt42igt3sZnk5xQ&oe=6A9FF9A9"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "2021434771935352", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_2021434775268685_6590123821025248007_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hbi6YRQukQ0Q7kNvwHENEEL&_nc_oc=Adp1YEUPhzlmtig3EAmNJDy8rEGQI8GOp_6lA0pBtY600ZCeHX0Mitm2_bghxxm9Xvo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKh8TEAPktLzw1MJSIkY9bS6-4YvYxlpR4aAz68_BhAfQ&oe=6AA02764"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "844824711837310", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820387_844824715170643_6320124407736170360_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CQ5Nypl0jqsQ7kNvwFACfTh&_nc_oc=AdpoKxOcdX9m8-qMEPoEMxRtG-q4p4YUdSO48N2IkmGX4kq-mZjwUA72sEJQ2zVHTmM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLoMSBL4wMVWIpfRG-O_cyZS4hDoFQZcLD3ofTvSrLuvA&oe=6AA014DF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "video.png", "id": "1158007726527989", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1158007729861322_4366745914975228266_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=70fEpWVPOdAQ7kNvwH--FAp&_nc_oc=AdqQsVGAB3Q3AcXNhiREO1uJiOkEXZ7fGpU_N8nMJ8wCxvYbdNd44tZOquGvmXd-ArE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIoPXhTruOjfkG7_-d6wgiKbXxqFG37DoeP20Q5kWzRig&oe=6A9FFD7B"}, "display_name": "Balloon Duel: The Keepy-Uppy Game", "keywords": ["reflexes", "nostalgia", "family", "casual", "MR"], "long_description": "**Your favorite childhood game is back \u2014 only this time, it\u2019s on a whole new level.**  \n\nThanks to mixed reality, **Balloon Duel: The Keepy-Uppy Game** turns your home into a lively playground where every hit feels real. The balloon bounces off your furniture, flies through portals, and dodges fans and other surprises that keep every match unpredictable.  \n\nChallenge a cast of **AI opponents with distinct personalities** \u2014 some are lightning-fast, others deviously smart, and all will push your reflexes to the limit.  \n\nAs you rise through the challenges, **your surroundings evolve**: floating rocks drift across the room, ice cubes spin in midair, corn cobs roll under your feet, and neon lights transform your home into a surreal playground.  \n\n**Balloon Duel** blends nostalgia with modern mixed reality to create something simple, immediate, and irresistibly fun.  \n\n**Because sometimes, the best game is the one that makes you feel like a kid again, playing with a balloon.**\n", "short_description": "The childhood classic returns in mixed reality. Use your real hands to keep the balloon in the air as your home fills with surprises\u2014portals, fans, and other unexpected twists that change every match.\nSometimes, the best game is the one that makes you feel like a kid again, playing with a balloon."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "698247719497381", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Balloon Duel", "keywords": ["globo", "nostalgia", "familiar", "casual", "MR"], "long_description": "**El juego de tu infancia vuelve, pero esta vez lo hace a lo grande.**  \n\nGracias a la realidad mixta, **Balloon Duel** transforma tu hogar en un campo de juego lleno de acci\u00f3n, donde cada golpe al globo se siente real. Rebota entre tus muebles, atraviesa portales que lo lanzan a otro punto de la habitaci\u00f3n y esquiva ventiladores y otros efectos que cambian las reglas cuando menos lo esperas.  \n\nEnfr\u00e9ntate a **rivales virtuales con estilos y personalidades \u00fanicas**: algunos son veloces, otros precisos, y otros\u2026 simplemente impredecibles.  \n\nY justo cuando crees tenerlo dominado, **tu entorno empieza a transformarse**: rocas que flotan sobre el suelo, cubitos de hielo que giran a tu alrededor, mazorcas que cruzan la sala o luces que convierten tu habitaci\u00f3n en un paisaje de ne\u00f3n o en una locura espacial.  \n\n**Balloon Duel** combina la nostalgia con la tecnolog\u00eda moderna para ofrecer una experiencia simple, directa y terriblemente divertida.  \nUn homenaje a esos momentos en los que solo hac\u00eda falta un globo\u2026 para pasarlo en grande.\n", "short_description": "El cl\u00e1sico de tu infancia vuelve en realidad mixta. Usa tus manos reales para mantener el globo en el aire mientras tu casa se llena de sorpresas: portales, ventiladores y otros giros inesperados que cambiar\u00e1n cada partida. A veces, el mejor juego\u2026 es el que te hace sentir otra vez como un cr\u00edo disfrutando con un globo."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ivanovichgames.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ivanovich Games", "support_websi